# Dockerfile.parity is a toolchain-only image: it COPYs nothing, because
# compose.parity.yml bind-mounts the working tree at run time. Excluding the
# whole context keeps `docker compose build` from uploading a multi-gigabyte
# node_modules/packages tree it would never read.
#
# If a future stage genuinely needs to COPY something, un-ignore that path
# explicitly with a `!` rule rather than deleting this one.
*
